    notes: >-
      The EvEMTBench dataset this benchmark evaluates on: point-on-wave EMT waveforms,
      window-level labels, per-episode settings and topology graphs. Hosted on FAUDataCloud,
      CC-BY-4.0; DOI 10.48742/fau.1fkx-ef11 reserved. The dataset paper is under review at
      Scientific Data; the data-generation code (PowerFactory) is archived separately.
